# Shift+Up selects from the caret to the start of the text, and typing replaces it while the task's dash stays.
file <<END
- Water the plants on the balcony
END
see Water the plants
keys <Enter> <C-Left> <C-Left> <C-Left> <Left> <S-Up>
type Repot the cactus
keys <Esc>
see - Repot the cactus on the balcony
quit
saved <<END
- Repot the cactus on the balcony
END
